{"ok":true,"name":"The Eighty Six","desc":"Stept’s 2012 ski film presents a migration from ski resorts, to cities, and back to the mountains. Everyone in the Stept crew skis, films, and works on the project together, sneaking from location to location, taking the term ‘guerilla filmmaking’ to new levels. Facing obstacles like broken cars, fires, law enforcement, competitions, water parks, parents and Denver Bronco’s Security, they’re able to consistently pick up, leave, and continue filming elsewhere. The Eighty Six.","year":2012,"rating":null,"ratingCount":null,"thumb":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/spk7D4otvHeXWv6ppIvz7X0po5R.jpg","servers":[{"name":"Server 1","src":"https://videm.xyz/embed/movie/&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 2","src":"https://vidapi.xyz/embed/movie/129751"},{"name":"Server 3","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vnest?tmdb=129751&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 4","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vcr?tmdb=129751&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 5","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vpls?tmdb=129751&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 6","src":"https://embedmaster.link/movie/"},{"name":"Server 7","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vesy?tmdb=129751&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 8","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vsrc?imdb="}],"genres":["Documentary"],"seasons":null,"duration":"PT40M","imdb":null,"related":[{"id":20561,"slug":"28-up","title":"28 Up","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MR6M5bX9r9HNf5SCWP9MRrEm8P.jpg"},{"id":193645,"slug":"seduced-and-abandoned","title":"Seduced and Abandoned","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaXPdoGRurNLgfyRrUDKsa95fYa.jpg"},{"id":661289,"slug":"the-summers-of-it-chapter-two-it-ends","title":"The Summers of It - Chapter Two: It Ends","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXtw9zyoRtt1PiF6MSBNpSYSHRu.jpg"},{"id":1723460,"slug":"a-toxic-love-story","title":"A Toxic Love Story","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CmyFXKqQRVbGGxyJE6kp7